  "prefLabel": "He-C 6350.03 Length of Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6350.03 Length of Certification.\n\n(a) Subject to (b) below, certification shall be valid through the state fiscal year and expire on July 1st, unless certification is voluntarily surrendered by the program, the facility closes, or certification is terminated or revoked by the department pursuant to He-C 6350.07.\n\n(b) If initial certification occurs in the months of March, April, May, or June, the certification shall be valid and shall expire on July 1st of the following year.\n\nSource. #4442, eff 7-1-88, EXPIRED 7-1-94\n\nNew. #6617, eff 10-25-97; ss by #8453, INTERIM, eff 10-25-05, EXPIRED: 4-23-06\n\nNew. #8693, eff 7-27-06; ss by #10759, eff 1-17-15; ss by #14178, INTERIM, eff 1-18-25; ss by #14490, eff 1-22-26, EXPIRES: 1-22-36",
